    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>fluid and responsive movement system</strong> that gives you complete control. Slide, dash, wall-run, and chain together advanced movement techniques to <strong>maintain speed and momentum</strong>. Every mechanic is finely tuned to provide a sense of flow and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652650/extras/4ed40dacaf1cd96895341c3efcf8719f.avif?t=1751650431\" width=616 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lucid</i> is more than just fast, it\u2019s designed for <strong>optimization</strong>. Find the most efficient paths, exploit movement tech, and shave milliseconds off your runs. Compete for leaderboard dominance or challenge yourself to achieve the <strong>perfect flow state</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652650/extras/1f8d43d5cccc405ff534ded8d27c3ef4.poster.avif?t=1751650431\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652650/extras/1f8d43d5cccc405ff534ded8d27c3ef4.webp?t=1751650431\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level in <i>Lucid</i> is built around <strong>momentum-based gameplay</strong>, offering multiple routes, skillful shortcuts, and seamless movement opportunities. Environments aren\u2019t just battlegrounds, they\u2019re playgrounds for <strong>speed and creativity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652650/extras/d70d046756ac4810e473d3342986f5ce.avif?t=1751650431\" width=616 height=133 /></span>Aggression and speed go hand-in-hand. The faster you move, the harder you hit, but one wrong move can be <strong>your downfall</strong>. Learn enemy patterns, refine your movement, and execute <strong>flawless sequences</strong> to dominate each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652650/extras/987871b106c4761e84def064b30e94bd.poster.avif?t=1751650431\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652650/extras/987871b106c4761e84def064b30e94bd.webp?t=1751650431\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=250 /></picture></span></p>",
