3 /></span>Aggression and speed go hand-in-hand. The faster you move, the harder you hit, but one wrong move can be <strong>your downfall</strong>. Learn enemy patterns, refine your movement, and execute <strong>flawless sequences</strong> to dominate each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652650/extras/987871b106c4761e84def064b30e94bd.poster.avif?t=1751650431\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652650/extras/987871b106c4761e84def064b30e94bd.webp?t=1751650431\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=250 /></picture></span></p>",
